### Regeneration and replay currently return FailedPrecondition until their services are wired
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacktheburgh.v1.AnduinService/RegenerateWorkflow
Content-Type: application/json
Connect-Protocol-Version: 1

{ "projectId": "{{projectId}}", "kind": "WORKFLOW_KIND_STATISTICAL" }

### Replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacktheburgh.v1.AnduinService/Replay
Content-Type: application/json
Connect-Protocol-Version: 1

{ "sourceIds": [ "{{csvSourceId}}" ], "periodsPerSecond": 10, "startFraction": 0.5 }
